{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14108410","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14108410","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1410841001:0":{"text":"何という巨大な……","source_cn":"初始之龙的身躯如山峦般巨大。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FF7227644C572FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1410841002:0":{"text":"これほどの巨体が空へ舞い上がる光景は、さぞ圧巻だろうな……","source_cn":"这样的庞然巨物一旦舒展身躯，腾空而起，那该是多么震撼的景象。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD036608F15B8BAD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410841003:0":{"text":"こんなデカい図体でどうやって飛ぶんだ……空気力学的に無理があるだろ。","source_cn":"这么大，到底要怎么飞起来呢……根本不符合空气动力学——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88AAF29FB0E7A230","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1410841003":{"text":"こんなデカい図体でどうやって飛ぶんだ……空気力学的に無理があるだろ。","source_cn":"这么大，到底要怎么飞起来呢……根本不符合空气动力学——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88AAF29FB0E7A230","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410841004:0":{"text":"ぐっ……魔法が使えるからって常識を無視してると、いつか足元をすくわれるぞ！","source_cn":"哼，真烦你们这些有了魔法就不讲常理的家伙！早晚有一天……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7DE629E86D6DC7B9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ぐっ……魔法が使えるからって常識を無視してると、いつか足元をすくわれるぞ！","female":"ぐっ……魔法が使えるからって常識を無視してると、いつか足元をすくわれるぞ！","variant_male_record_index":"158876","variant_female_record_index":"158877","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410841005:0":{"text":"って、そんなことより、竜とどう戦うのか、ちゃんと考えてるのか？","source_cn":"先不提这个！你们有什么对付龙的方案吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4802A43DCC5136DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410841006:0":{"text":"あいつが目覚めたら、あくび一つで辺り一面が吹き飛ぶぞ！","source_cn":"这头龙一旦醒过来，光是打个哈欠都能引发天灾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x426EA572A7DFF183","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1410841006":{"text":"あいつが目覚めたら、あくび一つで辺り一面が吹き飛ぶぞ！","source_cn":"这头龙一旦醒过来，光是打个哈欠都能引发天灾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x426EA572A7DFF183","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410841007:0":{"text":"本気で言ってるのか？この前はびくともしなかったんだぞ！？","source_cn":"认真的吗？你们也看到过，它只能听个响！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x906FB566EC70B2AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410841008:0":{"text":"目覚めた状態なら、また違うかもしれない。","source_cn":"那只是对付沉睡的龙，如果龙醒了的话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6B4C83FAD57577A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410841009:0":{"text":"うう、分かった。何事も試しだ！","source_cn":"好吧好吧！我也该对自己有点信心！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18BACD0B5385B40B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410841015:0":{"text":"一応、対策は考えてるようだけど……","source_cn":"这么看来，还是有点准备嘛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9DB9266B46B2B1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410841016:0":{"text":"竜の弱点とかは知ってるのか？","source_cn":"那么龙呢？龙有什么弱点吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98460D3C768F849A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1410841016":{"text":"竜の弱点とかは知ってるのか？","source_cn":"那么龙呢？龙有什么弱点吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98460D3C768F849A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410841017:0":{"text":"目？そんなとこ狙ってたら、こっちが先に丸焦げになるぞ！","source_cn":"……等看到眼睛的时候，我们就已经被烧焦了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7565BE86AF4E4EFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:0:1":{"text":"目だ。","source_cn":"眼睛","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x65863BF8B3E2D9F4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"目だ。","female":"目よ。","variant_male_record_index":"71718","variant_female_record_index":"71719","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1410841018:0":{"text":"それが弱点？あいつがちょっと動いただけで、とんでもない衝撃なんだぞ！","source_cn":"这真的是弱点吗？她随便动一下我们都得躲半天！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDFF9E2A4535F46B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1410841019:0":{"text":"体が大きい分、行動が制限されていると言いたいのだろう。","source_cn":"我想，梅林的意思是龙的体型也会限制她的行动。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3D9F3B4ED9B31E35","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"体が大きい分、行動が制限されていると言いたいのだろう。","female":"体が大きい分、行動が制限されていると言いたいのだろう。","variant_male_record_index":"158893","variant_female_record_index":"158894","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410841020:0":{"text":"特に、このような閉鎖空間ならなおさらだ。","source_cn":"尤其是在这种特殊的空间里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0EAE21786500574","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:1:2":{"text":"大きい体だ。","source_cn":"体型庞大","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x68A743EF3FE73F72","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"大きい体だ。","female":"大きい体よ。","variant_male_record_index":"71720","variant_female_record_index":"71721","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1410841021:0":{"text":"まあ、あいつにしてみれば、オレらはミジンコみたいなもんだよな。","source_cn":"确实，那家伙肯定对我们这些小生物看不上眼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21BD6C26E4AB08DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1410841022:0":{"text":"だが、その油断が隙を生むのだ。","source_cn":"她轻敌之际，就是我们的机会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3D1D346E6831279","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:2:3":{"text":"竜はプライドが高いと聞く。","source_cn":"傲慢","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE31A4CDD8577482A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"竜はプライドが高いと聞く。","female":"竜はプライドが高いと聞いてるわ。","variant_male_record_index":"71722","variant_female_record_index":"71723","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1410841023:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">逆鱗</style>？聞いたことあるぞ！","source_cn":"<style=highlight>逆鳞</style>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7784E05A5F450C1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1410841024:0":{"text":"たしか、竜の頭から喉にかけて、どこかに逆向きの鱗があって……","source_cn":"传说中巨龙的头部以下咽喉处有一块逆生长的鳞片——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56DCE02C3779D66E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1410841025:0":{"text":"竜の唯一の弱点なんだよな。","source_cn":"那是龙唯一的要害。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B998993EB7E201F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1410841026:0":{"text":"よし、もしこっちの話を聞いてくれなさそうなら、そこを狙おう！","source_cn":"万一……她根本不愿意听我们的辩解。就瞄准那里吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE25225DE1490DF7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1410841027:0":{"text":"ああ、いつでも準備はできている。","source_cn":"嗯，我想，我已经准备好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5ACC1FE34DE5AA2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1410841028:0":{"text":"ここに来るまでの私は、真相を探し、償いを求め、すべてを変えるきっかけがほしかった……","source_cn":"这一路走来，我想要知道真相，想要赎罪，想要寻找契机改变...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE6900967F7365C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1410841029:0":{"text":"だが今の私が望むのはただひとつ、人々に新たな可能性を示し、自ら選択する権利を与えることだ。","source_cn":"但最终，我只想为众人展现另一种可能性，让艾塞勒们拥有做...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87FD6925EED189BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1410841030:0":{"text":"真相を知り、己の道を選ぶ。それは原初の竜も同じであるべきだ。","source_cn":"初始之龙也不例外。她应该知晓真相，做出自己的选择。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24CD0C9D07DBF20A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1410841031:0":{"text":"何に対しても自分の態度を貫き、決して揺らぐことのない心……","source_cn":"对一切事物都绝无分别的态度。对目标毫无动摇的执着……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CC55BC38F3F5BDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1410841032:0":{"text":"岩の如く固い決意に、炎の如く熱い意志……か。","source_cn":"这份如山岩般坚定的决心，如烈火般灼热的意志……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA745A945C65999BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1410841033:0":{"text":"ドゥアガルを引け、インドラ！オレらを失望させんなよ！","source_cn":"因度厄，拉开杜恩加尔吧！别让我们失望！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD368F419963B7A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:3:4":{"text":"それに逆鱗もある。","source_cn":"还有逆鳞","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4A7322E6F6BCBD3F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"それに逆鱗もある。","female":"それに逆鱗もあるわ。","variant_male_record_index":"71724","variant_female_record_index":"71725","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"君の大砲がある。","source_cn":"你的炮台","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCBFDF94D7D2D6B61","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"君の大砲がある。","female":"あなたの大砲があるわ。","variant_male_record_index":"71712","variant_fema